window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>How can you crave someone as intensely as you hate them?</i></b></p> <p>Finn Novak is one of the young gods who rule this town and wreaks havoc wherever he goes. He’s above everything, even the law.</p> <p>I never thought I’d be thrust into his world of depraved privilege until tragedy strikes, and I’m forced to attend Maverick Prep, his domain.</p> <p>I vow to keep hating him but quickly become trapped by his web of twisted mind games. I yearn for his barbed words as much as I hunger for his touch.</p> <p>Getting close to Finn means unveiling secrets that should stay hidden. But like bodies buried in shallow graves, skeletons never remain in the closet forever.</p> <p>I can’t escape him, though. His darkness feeds mine, and it’s only a matter of time before the void consumes us both.</p> <p>When the story is over, who will be revealed as the real monster? Finn or me?<br> <br> <i>*If you like morally gray characters, psychotic heroes, and badass heroines this is for you. This story contains dark themes that may be triggering to some listeners.</i></p>"; 
